message: "If you use these artifacts, please cite the paper below."
title: "JAMN Bot RAG Benchmark"
# No hardcoded DOI: Zenodo mints a version DOI on each GitHub release. A pinned
# DOI here points at a prior version and breaks new-version archiving.
authors:
